# A new world through the menus, across its first census, and Continue: plan 004 phase 01. At 640 by 480, scale 2, with the
# menus' places worked out as tests/run/ui/menu/fixtures/flow.script works them out. The pointer starts in the middle, at 320, 240.
# Once the world is open, run_game_census puts the clock 40 ticks before 06:00 on clock day 5, so the census comes about 40 ticks
# after the world opens.

1 move 0 -40                    # 320, 200: Singleplayer
+1 button left down
+1 button left up
+1 move 132 196                 # 452, 396: Create New World
+1 button left down
+1 button left up
+1 key w down
+1 key w up
+1 key e down
+1 key e up
+1 key e down
+1 key e up
+1 key k down
+1 key k up
+1 move -132 -194               # 320, 202: the seed field
+1 button left down
+1 button left up
+1 key 7 down
+1 key 7 up
+1 key enter down               # opens the world, between this tick and the next
+1 key enter up

+30 screenshot before.png       # playing, about 10 ticks before the census
+30 screenshot census.png       # the census screen, over the stopped world
+1 move 0 250                   # 320, 452: Continue, on row 8
+1 button left down
+1 button left up
+20 screenshot after.png        # playing again
+1 end
